[00:13.16]1. In preaching the Kingdom and teaching the truth,
[00:19.36]Our Lord showed us how to proceed:
[00:25.00]‘Search out those deserving and ready to hear,
[00:30.74]Those aware of their spiritual need.
[00:37.38]By greeting the household and wishing it peace,
[00:43.08]Then it may be that peace you’ll impart.
[00:49.98]But when they refuse you or turn you away,
[00:55.42]Shake the dust from your feet and depart.’
[01:05.52]2. All those who receive you receive him as well,
[01:12.00]Respond when their heart opens wide.
[01:17.84]Their right disposition for unending life
[01:23.18]Will impel them to serve at your side.
[01:29.88]And never be anxious about what to say,
[01:36.02]For Jehovah will help you to speak.
[01:42.40]Your answer when gracious and seasoned with salt
[01:48.68]Will appeal to the humble and meek.
